msgstr ""

msgid "Taiga「O-Oh nooo, I, I forgot!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡O-Oh nooo, s-se me olvidó!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's the matter?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Taiga「I, I promised Minorin we'd go have＿dessert together! I gotta go!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡L-Le prometí a Minorin que＿iríamos a comer postre juntas!＿¡¡Me tengo que ir!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey, are you okay? Your face is kinda＿red.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye, ¿estás bien? Tienes＿la cara algo roja.」"

msgid "Taiga「It's nothing! I'm fine! Totally fine!＿Nothing a little ice cream couldn't fix!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No es nada! ¡Estoy bien! ¡Muy bien!＿¡Nada que un poco de helado no cure!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Really? Be careful not to overeat＿though.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿En serio? Ten cuidado de＿no comer de más, eso sí.」"

msgid "Taiga「Okay, okay!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Bien, bien!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Is she really okay? She was nothing＿like her normal self just now......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿De verdad está bien? No parecía la＿de siempre hace un momento......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Well, she'll be fine on her own...... Now＿then, I think I'll kick back and relax.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Bueno, estará bien por su cuenta......＿Ahora bien, creo que me relajaré.）」"
